<v Speaker 1>Lee's letter to his student, O beloved son, containing a working rule of life for you in three braided strands, 8 inward principles distilled from one long look at the people of the world, a perfected guide at the center, and a few brief named realities of the inner life.

3
00:00:18.350 --> 00:00:26.670
<v Speaker 2>Take what is written here and steadily put it into practice, and through that practice, those matters which you do not yet understand will become clear to you.

