<v Speaker 1>As we look at the Master's letter, I am seeking to understand exactly how a disciple makes this transition from theory to action.

11
00:00:54.350 --> 00:00:58.870
<v Speaker 2>Because the disciple in this text, he brings so many questions to the Master.

12
00:00:58.870 --> 00:00:59.870
<v Speaker 1>Right, but the answer is

