14
00:01:02.990 --> 00:01:04.510
<v Speaker 1>They demand immediate action.

15
00:01:04.590 --> 00:01:05.150
<v Speaker 2>They do.

16
00:01:05.230 --> 00:01:07.470
<v Speaker 2>The master lays down a strict instruction here.

17
00:01:07.470 --> 00:01:09.630
